# Spring Boot Observability

Observability configuration governance is consolidated in the `spring-boot-actuator` rule, which covers actuator endpoint exposure, management server port, health detail policy, metrics visibility, profile-level posture, and security boundaries.

Apply the `spring-boot-actuator` rule whenever actuator endpoints, health checks, metrics, or management server configuration in `application*.yml` are introduced or modified.
